19
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:30,540
指的是一种艺术或工程方法 即在所有可能的上下文来源中
is the art or engineering techniques about how from all of the possible context sources we

20
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:38,220
我们究竟如何决定哪些内容进入上下文窗口 以便我们的大语言模型能生成最好的回答
have, how do we actually decide what goes into the context window so our LLMs can generate the best responses?

21
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,760
通常当我们谈论这个话题时
Often when we talk about this,

22
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:49,500
我们会说是上下文筛选 指的就是这条从上下文来源指向上下文窗口的小箭头
we talk about context curation and we mean this little arrow from context sources to context window.

23
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:55,360
但我们其实没有给这条小箭头足够的重视
But we're not giving this little arrow right there enough credit,

24
00:01:55,580 --> 00:01:59,720
在我看来 因为真正驱动它的是搜索工具
in my opinion, because what's powering this is the search tool.

25
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:06,140
或者说是一组搜索工具 真正决定了从上下文来源到上下文窗口的内容
Or search tools that actually decide what goes from context sources to the context window.

26
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:10,280
今天我们会来看一看我们有哪些不同的搜索工具
And today we're going to be looking at the different search tools we have.

