00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,600
在我们进入代码之前
Before we get into some code,

133
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:59,100
我想先讲几个构建优秀搜索工具的基本原则
I want to give you a few fundamentals of building good search tools.

134
00:09:00,140 --> 00:09:06,440
因为从表面上看，智能体搜索似乎非常直观
Because agentic search at the surface level seems very straightforward.

135
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,760
用户发出一个请求
The user makes a request,

136
00:09:09,940 --> 00:09:12,580
智能体用正确的参数调用正确的工具
the agent calls the right tool with the right parameters.

137
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,920
我看到有人在笑
I see someone laughing.

138
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:19,100
检索工具给出工具响应
The retrieval tool gives you the tool response,

139
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:23,160
然后你的智能体再用正确的答案来回复你
and then your agent responds to you with the correct answer.

140
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:31,280
在 Elastic，我们帮助很多内部和外部团队构建智能体来与
At Elastic, we help a lot of internal and external teams build agents to interact with

141
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:37,700
Elasticsearch 数据交互，而现实情况是，这个过程会以各种方式出错
Elasticsearch data, and the reality is that this can break in many different ways.

142
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:41,480
我今天只给你们展示三种
I'm just going to show you three today.

143
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:45,020
第一种是智能体根本不调用任何工具
So the first is the agent doesn't call any tool.

144
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:51,660
这意味着智能体认为自己可以仅凭参数化知识来回答这个问题
So this means the agent decides I actually can answer this question based on my parametric knowledge.

145
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:56,020
我不需要使用任何上下文检索工具
I don't need to use any context retrieval tool.

146
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:59,960
另一种问题是智能体调用了错误的工具
