我最近在和一位同事聊天
I was recently talking to a colleague of mine,

148
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:07,920
我问他，你的项目里最具挑战性的部分是什么
I was asking him what was the most challenging aspect of your project,

149
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,040
他说，你可能不会相信
and he was like, you won't believe it,

